        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Zalman King, Charlie Sheen, Bret Michaels\n- Works: In God's Hands\n- Companies: Sheen Michaels Entertainment\n- Bands: Poison\n\nFacts:\n- In God's Hands is a 1998 film by Zalman King.\n- In God's Hands was released through Sheen Michaels Entertainment.\n- Sheen Michaels Entertainment was a production company created by Charlie Sheen and Bret Michaels.\n- Bret Michaels gained fame as the lead singer of Poison.\n- Poison sold over 50 million records worldwide.\n- Poison sold 15 million records in the United States alone.",
